  "methodology": {
    "build": "Four fresh binaries built by the frozen run.py adapter/build helpers at -O2, separate translation units, no LTO. No workload executions or timings in this audit.",
    "inspection": "nm inspected allocator symbol presence. objdump -d output was split at function labels; direct call targets were extracted and main/tree instruction sequences inspected.",
    "commands": "nm BINARY and objdump -d BINARY were executed on each actual binary. Compile commands below are reconstructed from the same frozen helper and independent correctness build-command provenance, substituting each binary directory recorded in its raw dump.",
    "size_correction": "Removed main_size_bytes: the initial script stored len(function_body.splitlines()), a disassembly-line count, not bytes. No function size claim is retained; temporary binaries have been deleted.",
