    "historical_arms": "Generic custom and historical boehm_inline timing code call allocate/store. Both retain their historical wrappers and are separate from the prepared caller-inline comparison.",
    "verdict": "Actual -O2 instruction sequences support both caller-inline labels; no timing or binary-size claim is made."
